Name Kuwait Note #2

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Sheriff's Log
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Pretty big day today, caught a bandit tryna bust inta the safe at the 
Interactability_Text_Line_2 saloon with nothin' but some good ol' fashioned fisticuffs. Sucker didn't 
Interactability_Text_Line_3 even manage two hits before he was out cold and croakin' on the floor! 
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Well, by any means, bartender was grateful and gave me a few more drinks on the house.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 S'ppose I shouldn'tve drank 'em all in one go though, stepped outside  
Interactability_Text_Line_6 and saw this grand ol' metal tube of sorts pop outta nowhere on the horizon!
Interactability_Text_Line_7 The tremendous sound'a somethin' goin' "ZAP!" rollin' through the air like thunder!
Interactability_Text_Line_8 Almost made me buckle to my knees. I'll wait it out in here,
Interactability_Text_Line_9 I reckon there's too much booze in me to think straight.